            "A Supply Chain Digital Twin is a real-time, dynamic software representation of the physical end-to-end supply chain network. It mirrors physical assets, inventory positions, transit pipelines, machine capacities, and transportation corridors across the globe. By ingesting streaming telemetry from enterprise ERPs, warehouse WMS systems, carrier EDI feeds, and IoT sensors, the digital twin maintains a continuous, synchronized digital shadow of global operations.",
